WEBVTT

00:00:00.102 --> 00:00:03.813
Three operators are at the center of most SQL
decision rules AND

00:00:04.019 --> 00:00:09.067
OR and NOT AND means that all connected conditions
need to be

00:00:09.093 --> 00:00:13.154
true OR means that at least one of the connected
conditions needs

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:18.657
to be true NOT reverses a known logical condition A
simple way

00:00:18.682 --> 00:00:22.046
to remember this is that AND usually makes a result
more restrictive

00:00:22.329 --> 00:00:26.904
while OR usually makes it broader But there is one
important detail

00:00:27.806 --> 00:00:32.819
SQL has a third logical state called UNKNOWN This
normally appears when

00:00:32.845 --> 00:00:37.265
null values are involved So as we work through these
examples do

00:00:37.278 --> 00:00:42.020
not assume every condition is simply true or false
Sometimes SQL does

00:00:42.033 --> 00:00:44.339
not have enough information to make that decision
